     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "The Roto Wheel Go Round puts an orange steering wheel at the centre of a small merry-go-round, with pink and blue seats around it. Children take turns steering and riding, so play often turns into a pretend drive. It suits the 3 to 9 years Key User Group and seats four. The unit takes up 4' x 4' and needs a safe play area of 10' x 10'. Its colours and steering wheel make it popular with younger children in a society garden or play school. The finish is multi colour. Galvanised pipes and roto-moulded parts carry a 3-year warranty, and the bearing is covered for 1 year. Send us your site details for a layout drawing and a quote."
     }
    ]
